{"availability":"available","full":"taskbase/tb-grid","name":"tb-grid","description":"tb-grid is a super simple and lightweight 12 column responsive grid system utilizing css grid.","category":"Design","language":"SCSS","stars":34,"forks":4,"created":"2021-04-28T17:10:28Z","updated":"2022-01-29T13:15:03Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"","topics":["12column","alternative","awesome","bootstrap","css","cssgrid","foundation","grid","grid-layout","grid-system","lightweight","minimalistic","responsive","scss","simple","skeleton"],"demo":"https://jsfiddle.net/bersling/t3uq9jnf/3/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T21:04:48.257Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T21:04:48.257Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T21:04:48.257Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T21:04:48.257Z","stars":34,"forks":4}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Lightweight (<1kb gzipped) 12 column grid system, built with css grid.","Bootstrap's grid system is awesome. With very little code you can add responsiveness to your html in a declarative manner. The use of 12 columns make the grid system extremely versatile since you can divide it into nice fractions (12/2, 12/3, 12/4, 12/6 - they all produce integers!).","However, there are also some things bootstrap didn't get right."],"features":["It requires too much nesting: .container > .row > .col. It would be great if we could drop the .container.","Being able to change gutters (aka. gaps) on a case-by-case basis is important, but it's a bit cumbersome in bootstrap.","The classes aren't scoped or namespaced. Furthermore .container and .row aren't that exotic that there would be no accidental collisions.","While at 50kb minified the grid system isn't huge, it's not exactly tiny either."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/taskbase/tb-grid/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"58ba361f344aaf105dc6af703f470470af74aaca00c46693d166f8cac4cac61b","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T21:04:48.566Z"},"overviewCh